  "notes": [
    "Reflexive -AR verb with e→ie stem change",
    "Stem change applies in presente (all forms except nosotros/nosotras): *despierto, despiertas, despierta, despiertan*",
    "No stem change in pretérito indefinido (unlike -IR stem-change verbs)",
    "Subjuntivo nosotros reverts to infinitive stem: *nos despertemos* (not *despertemos*)",
    "Past participle: despertado (regular)",
    "Non-reflexive: *despertar* = to wake (someone else); *La alarma me despertó* = The alarm woke me up",
    "*Me despierto a las siete* = I wake up at seven",
    "Related: el despertador (alarm clock), despertar (to awaken, to arouse)"
  ],
